# Local test/output data (not part of the installable package). Anchored to
# the repo root (leading /) so this does NOT also match docs/audios/ - that
# one holds the web debug page's fixed test input, which needs to actually
# be committed/deployed for docs/debug.html to work anywhere but this
# machine (an un-anchored pattern here would exclude the whole docs/audios/
# directory, and a !docs/audios/test.wav negation can't undo that - git
# won't descend into an already-excluded directory to check negations).
/audios/
output/
